BrightPath supports employee development through:

**Formal Learning:**
- Annual learning budget: INR 40,000 per employee
- Courses, certifications, or workshops (with manager approval)
- Online courses (Coursera, LinkedIn Learning, Udemy, industry-specific platforms)
