### 9.3 Succession Planning

For critical roles (executives, key technical positions), the company identifies **potential successors**:
- High performers identified as "ready now" or "ready in 1–2 years"
- Development plans created to prepare them
- Mentorship and stretch assignments accelerate readiness
- Transparent discussion of succession plans (where appropriate)

